  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting World Food Programme activities to provide food and nutrition assistance, enabling the UN Humanitarian Air Service to operate in crisis-affected areas, strengthening the capacity of national institutions to better manage food security.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Supporting World Food Programme activities to provide food and nutrition assistance, enabling the UN Humanitarian Air Service to operate in crisis-affected areas, strengthening the capacity of national institutions to better manage food security. is a component of Sahel Humanitarian Emergency Response Programme  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;73,000,000. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Emergency food assistance, Relief co-ordination and support services.</narrative>
  </description>
